1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,036
Before choosing any determiner, ask two questions.

2
00:00:04,036 --> 00:00:07,708
First: is the noun countable or uncountable?

3
00:00:07,708 --> 00:00:11,666
Books, chairs, students and villages can be counted.

4
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:19,270
Bread, information, advice, furniture and news cannot, even though their Nepali equivalents often can.

